    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7530" root="حرب" body-key="H">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حاربهُ</span></b> , (S, A, Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَارَبَةٌ</span> (Msb,
K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِرَابٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He waged,</i> or <i>contended in,
war with him; warred,</i> or <i>battled, with him.</i>
(S, * A, Msb, K.) See also 6. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became,
hostile,</i> or <i>an enemy, to him.</i> (S, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He
disobeyed Him;</i> namely, God. (TA.)

